,\n      \"id\": \"issuer_html.annual.bs.2024-09-28.equity\",\n      \"interpretation\": \"Selected rendered-row agreement supports representation checking; it does not establish whole-document equivalence or historical byte vintage.\",\n      \"label\": \"Total shareholders\\u2019 equity\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"document\": \"annual-2024-official\",\n        \"end\": 140260,\n        \"extraction_path\": \"docs/design/cases/apple/p02-v1/annual-2024-official.txt\",\n        \"extraction\nexternal {\n  \"agreement_interpretation\": {\n    \"interpretation\": \"Section 301 leaves series-specific principal/payment dates, interest terms and optional redemption to further instruments. Section 501 defines events of default with conditions; this case does not assert a default occurred.\",\n    \"missing\": \"2013/2018 indentures and series certificates remain external; the 2021 base indenture does not identify Apple's current swap reset schedule.\",\n    \"status\": \"selected_contract_sections_only\",\n    \"support\": [\n      {\n        \"document\": \"registration-2021\",\n        \"end\": 97845,\n        \"extraction_path\": \"docs/design/cases/apple/p02-v1/registration-2021.txt\",\n        \"extraction_sha256\": \"0736f98e4676e0111803445efce78b9bf4c3db33b1730feaa8272445edc46285\",\n        \"offset_unit\": \"Unicode code points\",\n        \"original_path\": \"docs/design/cases/apple/p02-v1/registration-2021.html\",\n        \"original_sha256\": \"bed77c1fa9b7e873523daa6e0fa9e05dc9791aa547d1b944d4af0742b3fa04df\",\n        \"quote\": \"Exhibit 4.1\\nApple Inc.\\nas Issuer\\nand\\nThe Bank of New York Mellon\\nTrust Company, N.A.,\\nas Trustee\\nINDENTURE\\nDated as of October\\u00a028, 2021\",\n        \"start\": 97710\n      },\n      {\n        \"document\": \"registration-2021\",\n        \"end\": 162742,\n        \"extraction_path\": \"docs/design/cases/apple/p02-v1/registration-2021.txt\",\n        \"extraction_sha256\": \"0736f98e4676e0111803445efce78b9bf4c3db33b1730feaa8272445edc46285\",\n        \"offset_unit\": \"Unicode code points\",\n        \"original_path\": \"docs/design/cases/apple/p02-v1/registration-2021.html\",\n        \"original_sha256\": \"bed77c1fa9b7e873523daa6e0fa9e05dc9791aa547d1b944d4af0742b3fa04df\",\n        \"quote\": \"Section\\u00a0301.\\nAmount\\nUnlimited; Issuable in Series\\n.\\nThe aggregate principal amount of Securities which may be authenticated and delivered under this\\nIndenture is unlimited.\\nThe Securities may be issued in one or more series. There shall be established in or pursuant to (a)\\u00a0a\\nBoard Resolution or pursuant to authority granted by a Board Resolution and, subject to Section\\u00a0303, set forth, or determined in the manner provided, in an Officer\\u2019s Certificate, or (b)\\u00a0one or more indentures supplemental hereto,\\nprior to the issuance of Securities of any series:\\n(1)\\nthe title of the Securities of the series (which shall distinguish the Securities of the series from Securities of any\\nother series);\\n(2)\\nthe limit, if any, on the aggregate principal amount of the Securities of the series which may be authenticated and\\ndelivered under this Indenture (except for Securities authenticated and delivered upon registration of transfer of, or in exchange for, or in lieu of, other Securities of the series pursuant to Section\\u00a0304, Section\\u00a0305, Section\\u00a0306,\\nSection\\u00a0906, Section\\u00a01107 or Section\\u00a01405 and except for any Securities which, pursuant to Section\\u00a0303, are deemed never to have been authenticated and delivered hereunder);\\nprovided\\n,\\nhowever\\n, th\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
