x:nonFraction> billion and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"usd\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-18\\\" decimals=\\\"-8\\\" name=\\\"us-gaap:HedgedLiabilityFairValueHedge\\\" scale=\\\"9\\\" id=\\\"f-518\\\">13.5</ix:nonFraction> billion, respectively.</span></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:18pt;text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%\\\">Accounts Receivable</span></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:9pt;text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\">Trade Receivables</span></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\">As of December&#160;28, 2024, the Company had <ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"customer\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-89\\\" decimals=\\\"INF\\\" name=\\\"aapl:NumberOfCustomersWithSignificantAccountsReceivableBalance\\\" format=\\\"ixt-sec:numwordsen\\\" scale=\\\"0\\\" id=\\\"f-519\\\">two</ix:nonFraction> customers that individually represented 10% or more of total trade receivables, which accounted for <ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"number\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-90\\\" decimals=\\\"2\\\" name=\\\"us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1\\\" scale=\\\"-2\\\" id=\\\"f-520\\\">18</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"number\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-91\\\" decimals=\\\"2\\\" name=\\\"us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1\\\" scale=\\\"-2\\\" id=\\\"f-521\\\">11</ix:nonFraction>%. The Company&#8217;s third-party cellular network carriers accounted for <ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"number\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-92\\\" decimals=\\\"2\\\" name=\\\"us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1\\\" scale=\\\"-2\\\" id=\\\"f-522\\\">33</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"number\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-93\\\" decimals=\\\"2\\\" name=\\\"us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1\\\" scale=\\\"-2\\\" id=\\\"f-523\\\">38</ix:nonFraction>% of total trade receivables as of December&#160;28, 2024 and September&#160;28, 2024, respectively. The Company requires third-party credit support or collateral from certain customers to limit credit risk.</span></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:18pt;text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\">Vendor Non-Trade Receivables</span></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\">The Company has non-trade receivables from certain of its manufacturing vendors resulting from the sale of components to these vendors who manufacture subassemblies or assemble final products for the Company. The Company purchases these components directly from suppliers. The Company does not reflect the sale of these components in products net sales. Rather, the Company recognizes any gain on these sales as a reduction of products cost of sales when the related final products are sold by the Company. As of December&#160;28, 2024, the Company had <ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"vendor\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-94\\\" decimals=\\\"INF\\\" name=\\\"aapl:NumberOfSignificantVendors\\\" format=\\\"ixt-sec:numwordsen\\\" scale=\\\"0\\\" id=\\\"f-524\\\">two</ix:nonFraction> vendors that individually represented 10% or more of total vendor non-trade receivables, which accounted f</span><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\">or </span><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\"><ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"number\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-95\\\" decimals=\\\"2\\\" name=\\\"us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1\\\" scale=\\\"-2\\\" id=\\\"f-525\\\">43</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\"> and </span><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\"><ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"number\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-96\\\" decimals=\\\"2\\\" name=\\\"us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1\\\" scale=\\\"-2\\\" id=\\\"f-526\\\">24</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\">. A</span><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\\\">s of September&#160;28, 2024, the Company had <ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"vendor\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-97\\\" decimals=\\\"INF\\\" name=\\\"aapl:NumberOfSignificantVendors\\\" format=\\\"ixt-sec:numwordsen\\\" scale=\\\"0\\\" id=\\\"f-527\\\">two</ix:nonFraction> vendors that individually represented 10% or more of total vendor non-trade receivables, which accounted for <ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"number\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-98\\\" decimals=\\\"2\\\" name=\\\"us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1\\\" scale=\\\"-2\\\" id=\\\"f-528\\\">44</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef=\\\"number\\\" contextRef=\\\"c-99\\\" decimals=\\\"2\\\" name=\\\"us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1\\\" scale=\\\"-2\\\" id=\\\"f-529\\\">23</ix:nonFraction>%.</span></div></ix:continuation><div id=\\\"i248a31500c42474f94fb8d3d2dd90051_49\\\"></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:18pt;text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%\\\"\",\ndata/accounting-master/deliverables/P02/case.json:5095:      \"semantic_completion\": false,\ndata/accounting-master/deliverables/P02/case.json:5130:      \"linked_quantities\": [],\ndata/accounting-master/deliverables/P02/case.json:514